design\releases\0_0_2\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:57:**Renewable domain objects** — `ProjectState` reuses a `ProjectCard` object while content/sha/activity/conversations are unchanged, and only creates a new object on genuine renewal. Cards have stable `header.internalId`; paths are persistence addresses, not identity. `ActionService` produces renewable `ActionDefinition`s, but some action-editor-state changes mutate the existing object and still emit `changed` — object identity alone isn't a complete action-tab signal.
